              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "file_id",
                  "description": "(Required) The unique identifier that represents a file.\n\nThe ID for any file can be determined\nby visiting a file in the web application\nand copying the ID from the URL. For example,\nfor the URL `https://*.app.box.com/files/123`\nthe `file_id` is `123`."
